# .env.example — R.E.A.C.T. / SupplyChain Guardian
#
# This project currently has NO required environment variables.
#
# Scan results (src/main.py, src/modules/*.py, src/data/*.py):
#   - No os.environ / os.getenv calls found anywhere in the Python source.
#   - The browser dashboard (src/dashboard.html) makes no API calls and
#     requires no tokens. The Leaflet map uses OpenStreetMap tiles via CDN
#     with no key required.
